Subject: [PATCH] Return immediately in isLayoutOnly() if obj is dead

---
 src/orca/script_utilities.py | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

Index: gnome-orca/src/orca/script_utilities.py
